    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this beautiful three-bedroom mid-terraced family home with a sunny south facing rear garden to the market in the exclusive Rathlawns Development. The Rathlawns Development is located in the heart of Rathcoole and has every amenity imaginable on its doorstep. Within a stone's throw you will find local bars, shops, schools, Avoca and Rathcoole Park along with a host of bus routes, the N7 and M50 road networks, the location is truly next to none. \r\n\r\nBright, airy and well laid out living accommodation of c. 76 sqm consists of; entrance hallway, living room with fireplace and fully fitted kitchen/dining area to the rear. On the first floor you have three generous bedrooms and main family bathroom which comes fully tiled. To the rear of the property you have a fully enclosed private garden of the lowest maintenance which comes with a sunny south facing orientation making it perfect for relaxing on them long sunny summer evenings with the use of rear laneway access also. The front couldn't be any better located on a peaceful cul de sac with no passing traffic and private off-street parking. \r\n\r\nNo.12 comes to the market in great condition throughout having been lovingly maintained by its current owners with no expense spared when upgrading in recent years, we see this one being extremely popular with first time buyers looking to get onto the property ladder in a highly sought after area or any keen investor looking to capitalise on the strong rents in the area, it has a list of additional features including three generous bedrooms, tiled family bathroom, off street parking, gas fired central heating and sunny low maintenance rear garden to name a few! \r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly advised - Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today. \r\n\r\nAdditional Features;\r\n- c 76 sqm\r\n- BER C\r\n- 3 bed / 1 bath\r\n- Mid-terraced family home \r\n- Great condition throughout \r\n- Well-presented home\r\n- Spacious family home \r\n- Tastefully decorated from top to bottom \r\n- Exclusive development \r\n- Gas fired central heating\r\n- Double glazed windows\r\n- PVC front door \r\n- Top quality blinds \r\n- Entrance hallway \r\n- Large living room \r\n- Fireplace \r\n- Fully fitted kitchen \r\n- Open plan kitchen/dining area \r\n- Three generous bedrooms \r\n- Main family bathroom\r\n- Bathroom fully tiled \r\n- Well maintained rear garden\r\n- Private & fully enclosed \r\n- Of the lowest maintenance \r\n- Sunny south facing orientation \r\n- Perfect for relaxing on them long sunny summer evenings \r\n- Laneway access to the rear \r\n- Private off-street parking to the front \r\n- Located on peaceful cul de sac \r\n- Heart of Rathcoole Village \r\n- Walking distance to all local amenities \r\n- Viewing highly advised \r\n- Location Location Location \r\n\r\nDirections\r\n\r\nEntering Rathcoole at the roundabout next to Avoca, continue through the village on Main Street. When you get towards the top of the village, take the left turn onto Johnstown Road. Continue straight over the mini roundabout onto School Road where you will turn right into Rathlawns and then turn right again where number 12 will be clearly sign posted on the right."
      },
